            "review_text": "devdulai\nBrighton, Australia26 contributions\n0\nBest Thai restaurant\nMar 2026 • Couples\nWe stayed at the Ibis near the Airport as we had a flight to Hong Kong in the early hours. Looked for a Thai restaurant and stumbled across this one which has good reviews. The food here is great, the pork skewers were so tender and fresh, they are a must try. I also ordered chicken Pad Thai, was one of the best I’ve had ever. The wife had beef red curry, the portion was generous and very tasty. They have friendly staff that understand a little English and we also used a translate app where there may have been some communication issues. Highly recommend coming here if you are staying at Ibis as it’s a 2 min walk and situated behind it. They have also won some awards in previous years and it shows with their food.\nRead more\nWritten March 22, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
