            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n17\nLovely Thai close to Saigon Airport.\nJan 2025 • Couples\nWe were staying at the nearby Ibis Airport hotel before a morning flight to Singapore when we decided to explore the local neighborhood for dinner. This restaurant was just over 5 minutes walk away and we were drawn in by the very authentic Thai menu and the dinners already enjoying their meals.\n\nMy partner ordered a cocktail as we selected a variety of dishes to share. The food was very tasty, with just enough chili heat for flavour, yet comfortable enough to eat. The service also was spot on and super friendly, with the two people serving us speaking a bit of English. We ate till we were completely full and even with a cocktail order, the total price was super reasonable, coming to just over 700k VND. This is a fraction of what the same meal would cost back in Singapore. Well worth trying if you are near Saigon airport.\nRead more\nWritten January 20, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
